{"title": "Aegis of the Absolute", "pageid": 35465, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Aegis_of_the_Absolute", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Spells", "Level 9 Spells", "Evocation spells"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Aegis\" title=\"Absolute's Aegis\">Absolute's Aegis</a>        </div>\n<div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Aegis_of_the_Absolute.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Aegis_of_the_Absolute.webp/300px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute.webp, /w/images/3/30/Aegis_of_the_Absolute.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Aegis_of_the_Absolute.webp/300px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Aegis_of_the_Absolute.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Aegis of the Absolute</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 9 evocation spell</a>.  It cannot be learned by party members.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nThe Netherbrain can make itself <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all types of damage it took in a round of combat until the start of its next turn.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Aegis_of_the_Absolute\"> Condition: Aegis of the Absolute </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_(Condition)\" title=\"Aegis of the Absolute (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aegis of the Absolute\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_(Condition)\" title=\"Aegis of the Absolute (Condition)\">Aegis of the Absolute</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The Netherbrain is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all types of damage it took in the previous round until the start of its next turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Netherbrain\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherbrain\">Netherbrain</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715053114\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2072/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20770/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8022/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1024515/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n132.03%   56.065     23 Template:Trim\n100.00%   42.463      1 -total\n 97.37%   41.348      1 Template:Feature_page\n 21.39%    9.082      1 Template:Condition\n 19.02%    8.076      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 13.14%    5.580      3 Template:Icon_text\n  9.85%    4.182      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n  9.77%    4.149      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.10%    3.865      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  7.32%    3.110      1 Template:Range\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35465-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715053114 and revision id 362564